#. Block title
#: blocks/comments-link/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Comments (link)"
msgstr "Reacties (link)"

#. Block description
#: blocks/comments-link/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Shows the number of comments and jumps to the comment form. Meant as a child"
" of the interaction bar."
msgstr ""
"Toont het aantal reacties en springt naar het reactieformulier. Bedoeld als "
"kind van de interactiebalk."

#: blocks/comments-link/index.js:11
msgid "14 comments"
msgstr "14 reacties"

#: blocks/comments-link/render.php:26
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Reacties"

#. %d: number of comments
#: blocks/comments-link/render.php:32
msgid "%d comment"
msgid_plural "%d comments"
msgstr[0] "%d reactie"
msgstr[1] "%d reacties"

#. Block description
#: blocks/interaction-bar/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Fixed bar at the bottom of the screen with sharing, comments and rating. "
"Hides when scrolling down."
msgstr ""
"Vaste balk onderaan het scherm met delen, reacties en waardering. Verbergt "
"bij omlaag scrollen."

#. Block title
#: blocks/interaction-bar/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Interaction bar"
msgstr "Interactiebalk"

#. Block title
#: blocks/rating/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Rating"
msgstr "Waardering"

#. Block description
#: blocks/rating/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Thumbs up/down, visible right away. Optionally followed by an explanation "
"and, depending on the vote, an offer to post it as a comment or to get in "
"touch."
msgstr ""
"Duim omhoog/omlaag, direct zichtbaar. Optioneel gevolgd door een toelichting"
" en, afhankelijk van de stem, het aanbod om die als reactie te plaatsen of "
"contact op te nemen."

#: blocks/rating/index.js:13 blocks/reading-progress/index.js:12
#: blocks/reading-time/index.js:11 blocks/toc/index.js:19
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Instellingen"

#: blocks/rating/index.js:15
msgid "Display"
msgstr "Weergave"

#: blocks/rating/index.js:16
msgid ""
"Determines the size and whether the explanation unfolds inline or appears in"
" a separate panel. Both fit equally well at the bottom of the article and in"
" the interaction bar."
msgstr ""
"Bepaalt formaat en of de toelichting inline uitklapt of in een los paneeltje"
" verschijnt. Beide passen zowel los onderaan het artikel als in de "
"interactiebalk."

#: blocks/rating/index.js:19
msgid "Large, with text (inline)"
msgstr "Groot, met tekst (inline)"

#: blocks/rating/index.js:20
msgid "Compact, icons only (bar)"
msgstr "Compact, alleen iconen (balk)"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:102
msgid "Thanks for your response"
msgstr "Bedankt voor je reactie"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:106
msgid "Enable JavaScript to be able to respond."
msgstr "Schakel JavaScript in om te kunnen reageren."

#: blocks/rating/render.php:40 blocks/rating/render.php:42
msgid "Like"
msgstr "Vind ik leuk"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:44 blocks/rating/render.php:46
msgid "Dislike"
msgstr "Vind ik niet leuk"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:55
msgid "Thanks for your thumb. What did you like about this page?"
msgstr "Bedankt voor je duim. Wat vond je goed aan deze pagina?"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:56
msgid "Thanks for your thumb. What could we improve about this page?"
msgstr "Bedankt voor je duim. Wat kunnen we verbeteren aan deze pagina?"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:58
msgid "Explanation (optional)"
msgstr "Toelichting (optioneel)"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:59
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Optioneel"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:61
msgid "Leave this field empty"
msgstr "Laat dit veld leeg"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:65
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Overslaan"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:66
msgid "Send"
msgstr "Versturen"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:74
msgid "May we post your comment below the article?"
msgstr "Mag je reactie onder het artikel geplaatst worden?"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:75
msgid "How can we contact you if we have more questions?"
msgstr "Hoe mogen we je benaderen als we nog vragen hebben?"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:78 blocks/rating/render.php:79
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Naam"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:80 blocks/rating/render.php:81
msgid "Email address"
msgstr "E-mailadres"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:86
msgid "Please enter your name and a valid email address."
msgstr "Vul je naam en een geldig e-mailadres in."

#: blocks/rating/render.php:90
msgid "No, thanks"
msgstr "Nee, dank je"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:95
msgid "Yes, post it"
msgstr "Ja, plaats het"

#: blocks/rating/render.php:96
msgid "Yes, that is fine"
msgstr "Ja, dat mag"

#. Block title
#: blocks/reading-progress/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Reading progress"
msgstr "Leesvoortgang"

#. Block description
#: blocks/reading-progress/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Thin bar at the top of the screen that shows how far the visitor is in the "
"article."
msgstr ""
"Dunne balk bovenaan het scherm die laat zien hoever de bezoeker in het "
"artikel is."

#: blocks/reading-progress/index.js:14
msgid "Element to follow (CSS selector)"
msgstr "Element dat gevolgd wordt (CSS-selector)"

#: blocks/reading-progress/index.js:15
msgid ""
"Defaults to .wp-block-post-content (block themes). With a classic theme use "
"the class of your content container, for example .entry-content. Even "
"without a correct value a common container is tried automatically."
msgstr ""
"Standaard .wp-block-post-content (FSE-thema's). Gebruik bij een klassiek "
"thema de class van je content-container, bijvoorbeeld .entry-content. Ook "
"zonder juiste waarde wordt automatisch een veelvoorkomende container "
"geprobeerd."

#: blocks/reading-progress/index.js:21 blocks/toc/index.js:69
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "Kleur"

#: blocks/reading-progress/index.js:27
msgid "Bar colour"
msgstr "Balkkleur"

#: blocks/reading-progress/index.js:37
msgid "Reading progress bar (thin bar at the top of the screen on the site)"
msgstr "Leesvoortgangsbalk (dunne balk bovenaan het scherm op de site)"

#. Block title
#: blocks/reading-time/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Reading time"
msgstr "Leestijd"

#. Block description
#: blocks/reading-time/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Shows the estimated reading time of the article, optionally as the time "
"remaining while reading."
msgstr ""
"Toont de geschatte leestijd van het artikel, eventueel als resterende tijd "
"tijdens het lezen."

#: blocks/reading-time/index.js:13
msgid "Show the remaining time while reading"
msgstr "Toon resterende tijd tijdens het lezen"

#: blocks/reading-time/index.js:21
msgid "~12 min left (example)"
msgstr "nog ~12 min (voorbeeld)"

#: blocks/reading-time/index.js:22
msgid "12 min read (example)"
msgstr "12 min leestijd (voorbeeld)"

#. %d: number of minutes left
#: blocks/reading-time/render.php:28
msgid "~%d min left"
msgstr "nog ~%d min"

#. %d: number of minutes left
#: blocks/reading-time/render.php:29
msgid "Finished"
msgstr "Uitgelezen"

#. %d: number of minutes
#: blocks/reading-time/render.php:36
msgid "%d min read"
msgid_plural "%d min read"
msgstr[0] "%d min leestijd"
msgstr[1] "%d min leestijd"

#. Block title
#: blocks/share/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Delen"

#. Block description
#: blocks/share/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Share button. The system menu on mobile, a popover with channels and a copy "
"button on desktop. Meant as a child of the interaction bar or to be placed "
"on its own."
msgstr ""
"Deelknop. Op mobiel het systeemmenu, op desktop een popover met kanalen en "
"kopieerknop. Bedoeld als kind van de interactiebalk of los te plaatsen."

#: blocks/share/render.php:24 blocks/share/render.php:26
#: blocks/share/render.php:29 blocks/share/index.js:12
msgid "Share"
msgstr "Delen"

#: blocks/share/render.php:44
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Gekopieerd"

#: blocks/share/render.php:46
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopieer"

#. Block title
#: blocks/toc-open/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Contents (button)"
msgstr "Inhoud (knop)"

#. Block description
#: blocks/toc-open/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Jumps to the table of contents of the article and opens it. Only appears "
"when the article contains a table of contents block. Meant as a child of the"
" interaction bar."
msgstr ""
"Springt naar de inhoudsopgave van het artikel en klapt hem open. Verschijnt "
"alleen als het artikel een inhoudsopgaveblok bevat. Bedoeld als kind van de "
"interactiebalk."

#: blocks/toc-open/render.php:23 blocks/toc-open/render.php:25
#: blocks/toc/render.php:29 blocks/toc-open/index.js:11 blocks/toc/index.js:88
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "Inhoud"

#. Block description
#: blocks/toc/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Automatic table of contents from the headings of the article, marking where "
"the visitor is."
msgstr ""
"Automatische inhoudsopgave uit de koppen van het artikel, met markering van "
"de plek waar de bezoeker is."

#. Block title
#: blocks/toc/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "Table of contents"
msgstr "Inhoudsopgave"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:21
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Titel"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:22
msgid "Leave empty for \"Contents\"."
msgstr "Leeg laten voor \"Inhoud\"."

#: blocks/toc/index.js:27
msgid "Show headings up to level"
msgstr "Toon koppen tot niveau"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:37
msgid "Hide this block when there are fewer headings than this"
msgstr "Verberg dit blok bij minder dan dit aantal koppen"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:38
msgid ""
"This is a threshold to hide the whole table of contents on a short article, "
"not a way to shorten a long list."
msgstr ""
"Dit is een drempel om de hele inhoudsopgave te verbergen bij een kort "
"artikel, geen manier om een lange lijst in te korten."

#: blocks/toc/index.js:45
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stijl"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:48
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Standaard"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:49
msgid "Compact (lighter, suited for a sidebar)"
msgstr "Compact (lichter, geschikt voor een zijbalk)"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:54
msgid "Collapsible sub-levels per top-level heading"
msgstr "Subniveaus inklapbaar per hoofdkop"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:55
msgid ""
"Useful with many headings: H3/H4 only appear after a click on their H2."
msgstr ""
"Handig bij veel koppen: H3/H4 verschijnen dan pas na een klik op de "
"bijbehorende H2."

#: blocks/toc/index.js:60
msgid "Text size (px)"
msgstr "Tekstgrootte (px)"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:61
msgid "Empty (0) uses the default size of the chosen style."
msgstr "Leeg (0) gebruikt de standaardgrootte van de gekozen stijl."

#: blocks/toc/index.js:75
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Tekst"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:80
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Achtergrond"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:91
msgid "Headings are filled in here automatically…"
msgstr "Koppen worden hier automatisch ingevuld…"

#: blocks/toc/index.js:94
msgid "(on the site, from the article text)"
msgstr "(op de site, uit de artikeltekst)"

#. Description of the plugin
#: reader-experience.php:4
msgid ""
"Reading tools and interaction for long articles: table of contents, reading "
"time, sharing and ratings."
msgstr ""
"Leesfuncties en interactie voor lange artikelen: inhoudsopgave, leestijd, "
"delen en waardering."

